sex. They just extra enjoyed it that way.

48
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:23,360
Here’s the thing, though: When Diablo sauce, or 
mango habanero, or Da Bomb isn’t something you’re

49
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:28,640
